bind File Patent Application: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Conduct Patent Search: Application ID, Search Result
bind Examine Patent Application: Application ID, Application Status
bind Grant Patent: Application ID
bind Reject Patent: Application ID
bind File Trademark Application: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Conduct Trademark Search: Application ID, Search Result
bind Examine Trademark Application: Application ID, Application Status
bind Grant Trademark: Application ID
bind Reject Trademark: Application ID
bind File Copyright Application: Application ID, Application Fee
bind Examine Copyright Application: Application ID, Application Status
bind Grant Copyright: Application ID
bind Reject Copyright: Application ID
bind Appeal Decision: Application ID
Application ID: integer between 1 and 1000000
Application Fee: float between 50.0 and 10000.0
Application Status: Pending, Approved, Rejected
Search Result: Clear, Conflict
Decision: Grant, Reject
Precedence[Examine Patent Application, Conduct Patent Search] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Examine Trademark Application, Conduct Trademark Search] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Examine Copyright Application, File Copyright Application] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Response[Conduct Patent Search, Examine Patent Application] |A.Search Result is Clear |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Response[Conduct Trademark Search, Examine Trademark Application] |A.Search Result is Clear |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Grant Patent, Examine Patent Application] | |T.Application Status is Approved AND A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Reject Patent, Examine Patent Application] | |T.Application Status is Rejected AND A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Grant Trademark, Examine Trademark Application] | |T.Application Status is Approved AND A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Reject Trademark, Examine Trademark Application] | |T.Application Status is Rejected AND A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Grant Copyright, Examine Copyright Application] | |T.Application Status is Approved AND A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Reject Copyright, Examine Copyright Application] | |T.Application Status is Rejected AND A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Exclusive Choice[Grant Patent, Reject Patent] | | |
Exclusive Choice[Grant Trademark, Reject Trademark] | | |
Exclusive Choice[Grant Copyright, Reject Copyright] | | |
Precedence[Appeal Decision, Reject Patent] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Appeal Decision, Reject Trademark] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |
Precedence[Appeal Decision, Reject Copyright] | |A.Application ID == T.Application ID |